OL,3,AMinneapolis withdrawal was 'surrender',
OL,4,ATrump's ex-border patrol chief tells
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former US border patrol chief who
OL,8,Fbecame the public face of the highly
OL,9,Fcontroversial deportation drive in
OL,10,FMinneapolis earlier this year has
OL,11,Fdefended the operation, describing the
OL,12,Fwithdrawal of agents from the city as a
OL,13,F"surrender" by the Trump
OL,14,Fadministration.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
