OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMinneapolis withdrawal was 'surrender',
OL,4,ATrump's ex-border patrol chief tells
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FGreg Bovino also told the BBC that he
OL,8,Fwas "not responding" to a lawsuit filed
OL,9,Fby the family of a woman shot dead
OL,10,Fduring the operation. He appeared to
OL,11,Fdismiss the legal action, praising the
OL,12,Fofficers deployed to Minneapolis and
OL,13,Fsaying "people do lawsuits all the
OL,14,Ftime".
OL,16,FBovino, 56, was removed from his role
OL,17,Fshortly after the fatal shootings of US
OL,18,Fcitizens Renee Good and Alex Pretti in
OL,19,FJanuary.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
