OL,3,AMinneapolis withdrawal was 'surrender',
OL,4,ATrump's ex-border patrol chief tells
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe two shootings, which were captured
OL,8,Fon video, triggered a bipartisan
OL,9,Fbacklash and widespread protests. US
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump then said he was
OL,11,F"going to de-escalate a little bit" and
OL,12,Fwithdrew hundreds of immigration agents
OL,13,Ffrom the city.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
